es with him here in the Hisil.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>And that's all? Too rare situation to 5-dot ability.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2297-thebadwolf","name":"TheBadWolf","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"149"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-17T05:30:15-07:00","id":140444,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheBadWolf</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/139809-5-dot-gift-for-elodoth?p=140361#post140361\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">And that's all? Too rare situation to 5-dot ability.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Not what it appears to be, considering the triggers.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/576-ephsy","name":"Ephsy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar576_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2615"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-17T08:29:40-07:00","id":140566,"title":"","content":"So, what if Elodoth won't so claim and fall in Kuruth?<br /> I mean, 5-dot ability must be more flexible.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2297-thebadwolf","name":"TheBadWolf","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"149"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-17T09:52:10-07:00","id":140658,"title":"","content":"You know that inevitable 30-man Kuruthfest we keep talking about with that poor Wolf-blooded in the middle of it? Swap with him. You're a Uratha. You can Gauru, Kuruth with them, and survive it.<br /> <br /> Your Irraka has slipped his way into position to observe a deal going down, but Cunning as he is, the poor guy is ridiculously gullible. Swap places with him and discern truth from lies.<br /> <br /> You're the negotiator, but you can't get to tur due to hostile ground. Your Irraka can, but he can't do the negotiation. He'll ghost to the edge and you'll walk in.<br /> <br /> You're the alpha, and the new dog seems to think he deserves first bite of the kill. Not allowed. Show him who's boss. It's a little overkill, but that's how you do things, he learns his place, you get your privileges, and not even a casual swipe to accidentally set off a fight.<br /> <br /> Your Rahu has been holding the line for a while now, but it's been a long, long fight. You've been bloodied, sure, but not even a scratch compared to how badly he's hurt. It's time to pull out. You can off-tank a bit to relieve pressure while you go into a full retreat.<br /> <br /> The negotiations aren't working out. Hostilities are rising. There's a bloodthirsty howl splitting the air when you hear your Rahu's voice: &quot;Tap me in.&quot;<br /> <br /> That's off the top of my head.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I call the Integrity-analogue the &quot;<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/822559-trying-to-understand-the-morality-system?p=825008#post825008\" target=\"_blank\">subjective stat</a>&quot;.<br /> An explanation how to <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/913221-using-social-manuevering\" target=\"_blank\">use Social Manuevering</a>.<br /> Guanxi Explanations: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/787518-the-mysterium-and-their-contribution-to-mage-society?p=787824#post787824\" target=\"_blank\">1</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/787518-the-mysterium-and-their-contribution-to-mage-society?p=788173#post788173\" target=\"_blank\">2</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/833863-mages-and-trading-favors?p=834531#post834531\" target=\"_blank\">3</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2758-errol216","name":"Errol216","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2758_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1112"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-17T14:21:55-07:00","id":140932,"title":"","content":"And all this is to say nothing of how the Meninna by definition can easily get the Facet that lets you add predatory mammals to your pack as soon as they have the Gift of Nature.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Memb